# Activity Diagram — Item Reserveren
```mermaid

    A([Start]) --> B[Student opent itemlist]
    B --> C[Student stelt filters in]
    C --> D{Filters ingevuld?}
    D -->|Nee| E[Toon alle items]
    D -->|Ja| F[Toon gefilterde items]
    E --> G[Student klikt op item]
    F --> G
    G --> H[Toon itemdetails]
    H --> I{Item beschikbaar?}
    I -->|Nee| J[Toon terugkeerdatum]
    J --> K([Einde])
    I -->|Ja| L[Student kiest startdatum]
    L --> M[Student kiest einddatum]
    M --> N{Datums geldig?}
    N -->|Nee| O[Toon foutmelding]
    O --> L
    N -->|Ja| P{Student ingelogd?}
    P -->|Nee| Q[Redirect naar login]
    Q --> R[Student logt in]
    R --> P
    P -->|Ja| S[Reservatie bevestigen]
    S --> T[Sla reservatie op in database]
    T --> U[Toon bevestiging]
    U --> K([Einde])
```
